    "detailed_description": "This is a world in a time of war. Every capable nation and organization has begun to expand its territory, and the player is the ruler of a small town (although it doesn't look like it's a town), relying on the player's skills and the town's inhabitants to keep the town alive in the face of an invasion from outside.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1<br />\r\nThe upper limit of the units of both sides is 1:1.5<br />\r\nThe game also has multiple caps, which players can adjust according to their hardware level, and the number of units on the field (the more the better, the more bugs).<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2<br />\r\nPlayers can increase their resources and acquire resources through cards and loot<br />\r\nPlayers can increase the stats of their units through loot and enhancements<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3<br />\r\n3<br />\r\n3<br />\r\nThis is a development of vegetable chicken ink for a year and a half of the work, due to force majeure reasons had to &quot;those who first reward&quot;, and the game in a stable but unstable state, not much content, a lot of bugs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n//<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you decide to &quot;reward from the best&quot;, then a final reminder of how long the game will last before you regret it<br />\r\n<br />\r\n//<br />\r\n\u76ee\u524d\u6682\u65f6\u6ca1\u7fa4\uff0c\u4f46\u662f\u53ef\u4ee5\u6084\u6084\u5173\u6ce8\u4e00\u4e0bB\u7ad9\u8d26\u53f7\uff1aWoolpe<br />\r\nbug\u53ef\u4ee5\u53d1\u9001\u5230\u90ae\u7bb1\uff1a2318453855@qq.com\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u662fB\u7ad9\u8d26\u53f7\uff08\u5237\u89c6\u9891\u7684\u65f6\u5019\u4f1a\u770b\uff09",
